---
layout: base.njk
title: IndieNodes
---
<div class="landing">
	<section class="hero">
		<h1>Stumble into work worth finding.</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			IndieNodes is a webring for indie creators: audio, comics and visual art, writing, and games.
			Not a platform — no accounts, no algorithm, no feed deciding what you see.
		</p>
		<div class="hero-actions">
			<a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.appUrl }}/">Explore the ring</a>
			<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ site.appUrl }}/join">Add your work</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="types" aria-labelledby="types-heading">
		<h2 id="types-heading" class="sr-only">What you'll find</h2>
		<ul>
			<li data-type="audio">
				<span class="type-label">Music</span>
				<span class="type-blurb">Tracks you can hear, from people who made them.</span>
			</li>
			<li data-type="comic">
				<span class="type-label">Comics</span>
				<span class="type-blurb">Pages and visual work, read in place.</span>
			</li>
			<li data-type="text">
				<span class="type-label">Writing</span>
				<span class="type-blurb">Excerpts worth the time they ask for.</span>
			</li>
			<li data-type="game">
				<span class="type-label">Games</span>
				<span class="type-blurb">Things you can actually play.</span>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="thesis" aria-labelledby="thesis-heading">
		<h2 id="thesis-heading">The data is the API</h2>
		<p>
			A single public file, <code>ring.json</code>, is the actual product. The field view, the
			widget members paste into their own sites, and anything built next are all clients of that
			file. Any one of them can be retired without taking the ring down.
		</p>
		<p>
			Traffic circulates between members' own sites rather than being collected here. IndieNodes
			does not need to be a destination for the ring to work.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-heading">
		<h2 id="principles-heading">What this refuses to do</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>No accounts, and no server-side tracking of anything you do.</li>
			<li>No recommendation algorithm and no behavioral inference, ever.</li>
			<li>Nothing plays sound without you asking.</li>
			<li>Likes never leave your browser.</li>
			<li>No AI artists. Every entry is the work of a person.</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="join" aria-labelledby="join-heading">
		<h2 id="join-heading">Are you a creator?</h2>
		<p>
			Joining takes about five minutes and needs a page you control. If you don't have one, the
			form will build you a small site to upload, ring badge already in the footer.
		</p>
		<div class="join-actions">
			<a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.appUrl }}/join">Join the ring</a>
			<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ site.appUrl }}/members">See who's in it</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</div>
